{"id":"da549ca22fc9a7df","group":"16","path":"16/16-thm-very-strong-characterization.md","title":"等式投影与对角","display":"thm-very-strong-equality-characterization — 等式投影与对角","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Jacobs — Categorical Logic and Type Theory","book_abbrev":"16","chapter":"1","label":"16-thm-very-strong-characterization","aliases":["16-thm-very-strong-characterization","16-thm--very-strong-characterization"],"display":"thm-very-strong-equality-characterization — 等式投影与对角","depends_on":["[[16-df-very-strong-equality]]","[[16-df-eq-fibration]]","[[16-df-internal-equality]]","[[16-df-comprehension-with-unit]]","[[16-df-pullback-square]]"],"source":"Proposition 4.9.3 and proof, pp. 306–307 (PDF 326–327)","revision_date":"2026-10-16"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Jacobs — Categorical Logic and Type Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"16"},{"key":"chapter","html":"1"},{"key":"label","html":"16-thm-very-strong-characterization"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>16-thm-very-strong-characterization</span><span>16-thm--very-strong-characterization</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-very-strong-equality-characterization — 等式投影与对角"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"f2143c499aae70cc\" href=\"?note=f2143c499aae70cc\" title=\"16-df-very-strong-equality\">16-df-very-strong-equality</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"478c99d853e13c93\" href=\"?note=478c99d853e13c93\" title=\"16-df-eq-fibration\">16-df-eq-fibration</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"93b3305f115fb8fd\" href=\"?note=93b3305f115fb8fd\" title=\"16-df-internal-equality\">16-df-internal-equality</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"7ef7c23f9a9f13d7\" href=\"?note=7ef7c23f9a9f13d7\" title=\"16-df-comprehension-with-unit\">16-df-comprehension-with-unit</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"dacf0503b95c88a9\" href=\"?note=dacf0503b95c88a9\" title=\"16-df-pullback-square\">16-df-pullback-square</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source","html":"Proposition 4.9.3 and proof, pp. 306–307 (PDF 326–327)"},{"key":"revision_date","html":"2026-10-16"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"p:\\mathcal E\\to\\mathcal B\">\\(p:\\mathcal E\\to\\mathcal B\\)</span> 满足 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"478c99d853e13c93\" href=\"?note=478c99d853e13c93\" title=\"16-df-eq-fibration\">16-df-eq-fibration</a> 的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{EqFib}(p)\">\\(\\mathrm{EqFib}(p)\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{CompUnit}(p,\\chi)\">\\(\\mathrm{CompUnit}(p,\\chi)\\)</span> 采用 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"7ef7c23f9a9f13d7\" href=\"?note=7ef7c23f9a9f13d7\" title=\"16-df-comprehension-with-unit\">16-df-comprehension-with-unit</a>，固定其终对象函子 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T\">\\(T\\)</span>、理解函子 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"C=\\operatorname{dom}\\chi\">\\(C=\\operatorname{dom}\\chi\\)</span> 与相应伴随数据。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\pi_X:CX\\to pX\">\\(\\pi_X:CX\\to pX\\)</span> 是同一理解结构的投影。</li>\n<li>内部等式 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Eq}_p(u,v)\">\\(\\operatorname{Eq}_p(u,v)\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\equiv_p\">\\(\\equiv_p\\)</span> 采用 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"93b3305f115fb8fd\" href=\"?note=93b3305f115fb8fd\" title=\"16-df-internal-equality\">16-df-internal-equality</a>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{VStrongEq}(p)\">\\(\\mathrm{VStrongEq}(p)\\)</span> 采用 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-9\" data-note=\"f2143c499aae70cc\" href=\"?note=f2143c499aae70cc\" title=\"16-df-very-strong-equality\">16-df-very-strong-equality</a>。</li>\n<li>对 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"J\\in\\operatorname{Ob}\\mathcal B\">\\(J\\in\\operatorname{Ob}\\mathcal B\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\pi_1^J,\\pi_2^J:J\\times J\\rightrightarrows J\">\\(\\pi_1^J,\\pi_2^J:J\\times J\\rightrightarrows J\\)</span> 是积投影，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\delta_J=\\langle\\operatorname{id}_J,\\operatorname{id}_J\\rangle\">\\(\\delta_J=\\langle\\operatorname{id}_J,\\operatorname{id}_J\\rangle\\)</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"E_J,q_J,d_J\">\\(E_J,q_J,d_J\\)</span> 在下文构造，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Iso}_{\\mathcal B}\">\\(\\mathrm{Iso}_{\\mathcal B}\\)</span> 采用 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-10\" data-note=\"dacf0503b95c88a9\" href=\"?note=dacf0503b95c88a9\" title=\"16-df-pullback-square\">16-df-pullback-square</a>。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\nE_J&amp;\\coloneqq\\operatorname{Eq}_p(\\pi_1^J,\\pi_2^J),\\\\\nq_J&amp;\\coloneqq\\pi_{E_J}:CE_J\\to J\\times J,\\\\\n\\{d_J\\}&amp;\\coloneqq\\{h\\in\\mathcal B(J,CE_J)\\mid q_Jh=\\delta_J\\}.\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\nE_J&amp;\\coloneqq\\operatorname{Eq}_p(\\pi_1^J,\\pi_2^J),\\\\\nq_J&amp;\\coloneqq\\pi_{E_J}:CE_J\\to J\\times J,\\\\\n\\{d_J\\}&amp;\\coloneqq\\{h\\in\\mathcal B(J,CE_J)\\mid q_Jh=\\delta_J\\}.\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{VStrongEq}(p)\\Longleftrightarrow\n(\\forall J\\in\\operatorname{Ob}\\mathcal B)\\mathrm{Iso}_{\\mathcal B}(d_J).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{VStrongEq}(p)\\Longleftrightarrow\n(\\forall J\\in\\operatorname{Ob}\\mathcal B)\\mathrm{Iso}_{\\mathcal B}(d_J).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>单位理解的伴随将位于 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"u:K\\to I\">\\(u:K\\to I\\)</span> 上的箭头 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"TK\\to X\">\\(TK\\to X\\)</span> 与满足 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\pi_Xh=u\">\\(\\pi_Xh=u\\)</span> 的箭头 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"h:K\\to CX\">\\(h:K\\to CX\\)</span> 对应。纤维为预序，且 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T\">\\(T\\)</span> 保持笛卡尔箭头，故这样的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"h\">\\(h\\)</span> 至多一个，从而 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\pi_X\">\\(\\pi_X\\)</span> 是单态射。反身性给出 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\top_J\\leq\\delta_J^*E_J\">\\(\\top_J\\leq\\delta_J^*E_J\\)</span>，所以定义 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"d_J\">\\(d_J\\)</span> 的集合恰有一个元素。无需满理解假设。</li>\n<li>正向：<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\top_{CE_J}\\leq q_J^*E_J\">\\(\\top_{CE_J}\\leq q_J^*E_J\\)</span>，即 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\pi_1^Jq_J\\equiv_p\\pi_2^Jq_J\">\\(\\pi_1^Jq_J\\equiv_p\\pi_2^Jq_J\\)</span>。非常强等式给出两基箭头相等；令 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"s_J=\\pi_1^Jq_J\">\\(s_J=\\pi_1^Jq_J\\)</span>，则 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\delta_Js_J=q_J\">\\(\\delta_Js_J=q_J\\)</span>。由 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"q_Jd_J=\\delta_J\">\\(q_Jd_J=\\delta_J\\)</span> 及 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"q_J,\\delta_J\">\\(q_J,\\delta_J\\)</span> 的单态射性得 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"d_Js_J=\\operatorname{id}\">\\(d_Js_J=\\operatorname{id}\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"s_Jd_J=\\operatorname{id}\">\\(s_Jd_J=\\operatorname{id}\\)</span>。</li>\n<li>反向：<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"u\\equiv_pv\">\\(u\\equiv_pv\\)</span> 当且仅当 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\langle u,v\\rangle\">\\(\\langle u,v\\rangle\\)</span> 经过 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"q_J\">\\(q_J\\)</span>。若 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"d_J\">\\(d_J\\)</span> 可逆，该箭头经过 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\delta_J\">\\(\\delta_J\\)</span>，于是 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"u=v\">\\(u=v\\)</span>。其余方向 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"u=v\\Rightarrow u\\equiv_pv\">\\(u=v\\Rightarrow u\\equiv_pv\\)</span> 由等式反身性已有。</li>\n<li>来源：Jacobs, Proposition 4.9.3 and proof, pp. 306–307（PDF 326–327）。已核对陈述和两方向证明；原书只要求 subset types，本轮移除旧稿多余的 full 限制，并把规范箭头构造写入 Assertion。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"16-df-very-strong-equality","status":"resolved","id":"f2143c499aae70cc","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[16-df-very-strong-equality]]","embed":false},{"target":"16-df-eq-fibration","status":"resolved","id":"478c99d853e13c93","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[16-df-eq-fibration]]","embed":false},{"target":"16-df-internal-equality","status":"resolved","id":"93b3305f115fb8fd","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[16-df-internal-equality]]","embed":false},{"target":"16-df-comprehension-with-unit","status":"resolved","id":"7ef7c23f9a9f13d7","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[16-df-comprehension-with-unit]]","embed":false},{"target":"16-df-pullback-square","status":"resolved","id":"dacf0503b95c88a9","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[16-df-pullback-square]]","embed":false},{"target":"16-df-eq-fibration","status":"resolved","id":"478c99d853e13c93","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$p:\\mathcal E\\to\\mathcal B$ 满足 [[16-df-eq-fibration]] 的 $\\mathrm{EqFib}(p)$；$\\mathrm{CompUnit}(p,\\chi)$ 采用 [[16-df-comprehension-with-unit]]，固定其终对象函子 $T$、理解函子 $C=\\operatorname{dom}\\chi$ 与相应伴随数据。$\\pi_X:CX\\to pX$ 是同一理解结构的投影。","embed":false},{"target":"16-df-comprehension-with-unit","status":"resolved","id":"7ef7c23f9a9f13d7","anchor":"ref-7","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$p:\\mathcal E\\to\\mathcal B$ 满足 [[16-df-eq-fibration]] 的 $\\mathrm{EqFib}(p)$；$\\mathrm{CompUnit}(p,\\chi)$ 采用 [[16-df-comprehension-with-unit]]，固定其终对象函子 $T$、理解函子 $C=\\operatorname{dom}\\chi$ 与相应伴随数据。$\\pi_X:CX\\to pX$ 是同一理解结构的投影。","embed":false},{"target":"16-df-internal-equality","status":"resolved","id":"93b3305f115fb8fd","anchor":"ref-8","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"内部等式 $\\operatorname{Eq}_p(u,v)$、$\\equiv_p$ 采用 [[16-df-internal-equality]]；$\\mathrm{VStrongEq}(p)$ 采用 [[16-df-very-strong-equality]]。","embed":false},{"target":"16-df-very-strong-equality","status":"resolved","id":"f2143c499aae70cc","anchor":"ref-9","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"内部等式 $\\operatorname{Eq}_p(u,v)$、$\\equiv_p$ 采用 [[16-df-internal-equality]]；$\\mathrm{VStrongEq}(p)$ 采用 [[16-df-very-strong-equality]]。","embed":false},{"target":"16-df-pullback-square","status":"resolved","id":"dacf0503b95c88a9","anchor":"ref-10","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"对 $J\\in\\operatorname{Ob}\\mathcal B$，$\\pi_1^J,\\pi_2^J:J\\times J\\rightrightarrows J$ 是积投影，$\\delta_J=\\langle\\operatorname{id}_J,\\operatorname{id}_J\\rangle$。$E_J,q_J,d_J$ 在下文构造，$\\mathrm{Iso}_{\\mathcal B}$ 采用 [[16-df-pullback-square]]。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"p:\\mathcal E\\to\\mathcal B","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{EqFib}(p)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{CompUnit}(p,\\chi)","display":false},{"tex":"T","display":false},{"tex":"C=\\operatorname{dom}\\chi","display":false},{"tex":"\\pi_X:CX\\to pX","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{Eq}_p(u,v)","display":false},{"tex":"\\equiv_p","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{VStrongEq}(p)","display":false},{"tex":"J\\in\\operatorname{Ob}\\ma