g-characterization]] 中的 $\\mathrm{EqFib}(p)$ 与 $\\mathrm{CompUnit}(p,\\chi)$；采用该页同一个指定理解结构。"}],"outgoing":["f2143c499aae70cc","478c99d853e13c93","93b3305f115fb8fd","7ef7c23f9a9f13d7","dacf0503b95c88a9"]}